It gives quite a few advantages, including faster HP and MP 
regeneration.  For instance, an XL 14 character regains 4.44 HP 
(average, but usually exactly 5) HP every 3 turns.  An XL27+ character 
regains 9.5 (average of 1d18) HP every 3 turns.

Now if we give the XL 14 guy AC -15 and the XL 27 guy AC -30 and 
conflict, we start to see why the first one needs to engrave Elbereth 
at every fight while the second one walks past monsters without 
engaging them.

> the side effect of more tough
