Wasn't this debunked a while ago?

An XL 14 character at DL 36 will be getting monsters of up to diff 25.  
That is, by my reading of the monster spoiler, every monster that can 
be randomly generated in Hell except arch-liches, which you should 
genocide anyway.  (And if you don't genocide arch-liches, they can be 
generated starting at DL 44, well before the Sanctum.)

